{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Water</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Mira, you wield the power to manipulate water into deadly weapons. Switch between various forms, melee or range, and experiment with different combos and strategies to overcome the diverse enemies that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/14b05f8edd57b8fe2431113096add166.poster.avif?t=1772697694\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/14b05f8edd57b8fe2431113096add166.webm?t=1772697694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Beautiful Landscapes and Seek Ancient Knowledge</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient ruins in diverse islands with unique characteristics, from lush islands to arid savannas. Each island holds ancient relics with historical value and the tribe's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/dffc4c8546077bc6a863551679df875a.poster.avif?t=1772697694\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/dffc4c8546077bc6a863551679df875a.webm?t=1772697694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Powerful Legends</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerf